x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{(\\sqrt{3x+1})^{2}-(\\sqrt{7})^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{3x+1-7} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{3x-6} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{3(x-2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3(2)+1}+\\sqrt{7}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{7}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264501 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264502 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264503 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264504 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264505 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1041 "selection" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1104 #edb/ref 17592186264502 13194139533898 true] [17592186264500 1110 #uuid "cdaf86b8-fe13-5914-bc47-1912531cc01e" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264501 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264501 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533898 true] [17592186264501 1111 #uuid "e9522321-d07c-5a20-b5a9-f2ebff52419f" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264502 1034 "\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{3}" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264502 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533898 true] [17592186264502 1111 #uuid "1b2dbd48-6baf-5e15-bbfb-b49df51606ff" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264503 1034 "\\frac{2}{7}" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264503 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533898 true] [17592186264503 1111 #uuid "934ab8eb-0b43-5dbc-8b63-94acc00d4e00" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264504 1034 "6\\sqrt{7}" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533898 true] [17592186264504 1111 #uuid "136c30fa-9044-52a8-8a49-837a101f76ef" 13194139533898 true] [17592186264505 1034 "\\frac{1}{7}" 1